    "reconstruction_notes": {
      "en": "Original living inspired-by broad thin cupped shield based on ROM basic H.palmata morphology, with real inner/outer surfaces, small attachment base and restrained diverging radial relief. No perforated panel, tube-sponge reuse or microspicule/net/canal count claim. Nominal0.13m span, muted ochre palette and irregular rim layout are art choices; genus forms vary and this selected shield is not universal.",
      "zh": "原创活体inspired-by宽薄杯盾，依据ROM H.palmata基本形态，具真实内外表面、小附着基部及克制放射脊。不做漏孔平板，不复用管状海绵，不声称微骨针、网格或水孔计数准确。0.13米名义展幅、柔和赭色及不规则口缘为美术设定；属内形态多样，所选盾形不是全属普遍形态。"
    },
